Package: unim
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: im-config
Description: Korean Input Method Engine
 UNIM is a modular Korean Input Method Engine.
 This package contains the core daemon, C-API library, CLI tools,
 and XIM/Wayland protocol support.

Package: unim-gui-gtk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libappindicator3-1
Conflicts: unim-gui-qt
Description: UNIM GUI and GTK IM Modules
 UNIM GUI process providing system tray indicator, Hanja/special character
 popups, and settings dialog. GTK4/libadwaita based.
 Also includes GTK3 and GTK4 input method modules.

Package: unim-gui-qt
Architecture: amd64
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: unim-gui-gtk
Description: UNIM GUI and Qt IM Plugins
 UNIM GUI process providing Hanja/special character popups.
 Qt6/QML based alternative to the GTK4 GUI.
 Also includes Qt5 and Qt6 platform input context plugins.

Package: gnome-shell-extension-unim
Architecture: all
Depends: unim (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, gnome-shell
Description: UNIM GNOME Shell Extension
 GNOME Shell extension for UNIM, providing native integration and hotkeys.
